    "preamble": "Perumalla Radha Krishna Murthy vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 19 March, 2020 1 The Hon'Ble Sri Justice A.V.Sesha Sai Criminal Petition No.1621 of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "1. This is an application, filed under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 ( for short 'Cr.P.C'), by the petitioners, seeking quashment of F.I.R. No.362 of 2019 of Bhimavaram I Town police station, West Godavari District, registered for the alleged offences punishable under Sections 328 r/w 511, 188 and 273 r/w 34 of the Indian Penal Code, 1860 and Section 54 r/w 59 of the Food Safety and Standards (Prohibition & registration on sale) Regulations 2011 and the Food and Safety and Standards Act,2006. 2.",
